<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="11">
<name>Control System</name>
<section id="60001_S0006" variety="S0006">
<name>Body Multiplex Communication [LIN]</name>
<ttl id="60001_S0006_741KA_T000J" variety="T000J">
<name>Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN]</name>
<para id="X39400000IH00WC" category="C" type-id="304N6" name-id="940AH-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2287</dtccode>
<dtcname>LIN Communication Master Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="X39400000IH00WC_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000007L00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) performs LIN communication with the instrument junction block assembly (main body ECU), the immobiliser code computer (ID code box) and the steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU). </ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>The smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) outputs this code when communication with the instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU) is interrupted for a certain period of time or longer.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="2.99in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="3.09in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2287</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>LIN communication malfunction between the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) and instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Instrument Panel Junction Block Assembly (Main Body ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Smart Key Computer Assembly</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Verification ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000IH00WC_11" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000007M00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162410J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000IH00WC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___000007N00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>When replacing the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU), refer to the registration procedure in the reference section.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When using SST (TaSCAN) with the ignition switch OFF, repeatedly turn any door courtesy light switch ON/OFF (at intervals of 1.5 seconds or less) until communication between SST (TaSCAN) and the vehicle starts.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU) is replaced with a new one and the battery negative terminal is reconnected, it enters the IG ON state. Also, when the battery is removed and reinstalled, it returns to the state it was in when the battery was removed.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000IH00WC_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000IH00WC_13_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___000007Q00000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000693012X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000IH00WC_13_0006" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IH00WC_13_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___000007P00000">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs of the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) or instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000693012X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.91in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Only DTC B2287 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCs B2785 and B2287 are output simultaneously</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000IH00WC_13_0001" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X39400000IH00WC_13_0002" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000IH00WC_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000007O00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Smart Key Computer Assembly - Instrument Panel Junction Block Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B157954J02" width="2.775699831in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the smart key computer assembly (certification ECU) connector and the instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU) connector C.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
